<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR SLIPS TO 10.43 FROM 10.46 PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR SLIPS TO 10.43 FROM 10.46 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered</p>
<p>Rate (Athibor) for one month eased to 10.43 from 10.46 percent</p>
<p>and the bid rate (Athibid) slipped to 9.93 from 9.97 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
